\subtree{
\title{9.2 What each candidate rule can reach}

\table{
\tr{\th{Rule}\th{Bound from the census}\th{Decision}}
\tr{\td{private per ACTIVATION, identified at the return (the brief's first cut)}\td{nothing: the hot blocks return what they build (NOTES-T3 section 5: \code{\verb~|BODY(#913)~} builds three suspensions, three applications and returns the outermost; \code{\verb~|RULE(List.rec)~} passes its application to \code{\verb~|TAILAPPLY~}); every block-built value leaves its activation as an argument or as the result}\td{NOT BUILT: by inspection it would identify everything it makes, one instruction later}}
